1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,650
Understand the problem, before deciding what to build.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,524
A chatbot gives one draft per person.

3
00:00:09,574 --> 00:00:15,650
Here, everyone gets the same interview, and the answers are counted together.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,637
No account, no app.

5
00:00:17,687 --> 00:00:22,698
One question at a time, on a phone or in a browser.

6
00:00:22,748 --> 00:00:25,650
It never asks where AI should go.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:35,650
Ten simulated colleagues became twenty-five themes, ranked, with the quotes behind each one.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,650
A department or a quote shows only when at least three people are behind it.

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,650
Take an opportunity into a requirements interview.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,650
Out comes a versioned specification: numbered requirements, acceptance criteria, a diff, and a bundle for your coding agent.
